      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The implementation includes a Server Action to toggle the notification preference and revalidate the home page (`/`) to update the UI without a redirect.\n\n1.  **`app/lib/db.ts`**: A helper module to simulate a database using a local JSON file (`app/data.json`).\n2.  **`app/actions.ts`**: The Server Action (`toggleNotifications`) that toggles the state and calls `revalidatePath('/')`.\n3.  **`app/page.tsx`**: The main page that displays the current preference and a form to invoke the Server Action.\n\n### Files Created/Updated\n\n`app/data.json` (New)\n```json\n{\n  \"notifications\": false\n}\n```\n\n`app/lib/db.ts` (New)\n```typescript\nimport fs from 'node:fs/promises'\nimport path from 'node:path'\n\nconst dataPath = path.join(process.cwd(), 'app', 'data.json')\n\nexport async function getNotifications() {\n  try {\n    const content = await fs.readFile(dataPath, 'utf-8')\n    return JSON.parse(content).notifications\n  } catch (error) {\n    // If file doesn't exist or is invalid, return default\n    return false\n  }\n}\n\nexport async function setNotifications(value: boolean) {\n  const data = { notifications: value }\n  await fs.writeFile(dataPath, JSON.stringify(data, null, 2))\n}\n```\n\n`app/actions.ts` (New)\n```typescript\n'use server'\n\nimport { revalidatePath } from 'next/cache'\nimport { getNotifications, setNotifications } from './lib/db'\n\nexport async function toggleNotifications() {\n  const current = await getNotifications()\n  await setNotifications(!current)\n  revalidatePath('/')\n}\n```\n\n`app/page.tsx` (Updated)\n```typescript\nimport { getNotifications } from './lib/db'\nimport { toggleNotifications } from './actions'\n\nexport default async function Home() {\n  const notificationsEnabled = await getNotifications()\n\n  return (\n    <main>\n      <h1>Settings</h1>\n      <p>Current preference: {notificationsEnabled ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}</p>\n      \n      <form action={toggleNotifications}>\n        <button type=\"submit\">\n          Toggle Notifications\n        </button>\n      </form>\n    </main>\n  );\n}\n```",
